# ai-dev-sandbox — network allowlist.
#
# Baked into the image, root-owned, and NOT writable from inside the container.
# Changing it requires `ccnet rebuild`, which only the host can trigger — that
# is deliberate, so a sandboxed process cannot widen its own boundary.
#
# api.anthropic.com is always permitted and must not be listed here; without it
# Claude cannot run at all.
#
# Two kinds of entry:
#
#   example.com      a domain. Reachable only while the airlock is OPEN.
#   tcp:host:port    an internal service. Reachable in BOTH modes, because an
#                    app must still reach its database while closed. Must
#                    resolve to a private address; a public one is refused.

# --- domains, reachable when OPEN -------------------------------------------

# Source control
github.com
api.github.com
codeload.github.com
objects.githubusercontent.com

# PHP / Composer
packagist.org
repo.packagist.org

# Node / npm / yarn
registry.npmjs.org
registry.yarnpkg.com

# Other registries — uncomment as needed
# pypi.org
# files.pythonhosted.org
# proxy.golang.org
# sum.golang.org
# crates.io
# static.crates.io

# --- internal services, reachable in BOTH modes -----------------------------
tcp:db:3306
